  "created": "2026-11-03T20:25:06.637Z",
  "description": "Command line player for Return to Zork, Zork Nemesis, Zork: Grand Inquisitor and Infocom's Z-machine games: dotnet tool install -g Gue.Player, then gue <game folder or story file>.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Gue.Player",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-03T20:31:40.72Z",
